    { "type": "text", "id": "final_caption", "x": 70, "y": 650, "width": 760, "height": 44,
      "text": "The local transaction, the idempotency key, the reconciliation job -- all three exist for one reason:\nto make the middle outcome the only one that's actually possible.",
